<https://w3id.org/mado#K25> <https://w3id.org/mado#statusDaRelacao> "CONHECIMENTO_CANDIDATO" .
<https://w3id.org/mado#K25> <https://w3id.org/mado#sustentadoPorTrecho> <https://w3id.org/mado#TD-EV27> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#K25> <https://w3id.org/mado#sustentadoPorTrecho> <https://w3id.org/mado#TD-EV28> .
